    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to test your rhythm skills? <strong><i>Hentai</i></strong> is a thrilling rhythm game where every beat counts! Match the notes that appear in sync with the rhythm, and don\u2019t miss\u2014each mistake will reduce your score. The higher your level, the more notes you\u2019ll need to hit perfectly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With gradually increasing difficulty, <i>Rithme</i> offers challenges for both beginner and veteran rhythm game players. Feel the adrenaline as the speed and complexity ramp up. Can you keep the rhythm and achieve the Maximum Level?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And, an addictive arcade game where you must help a slime dodge obstacles and survive for as long as possible! Jump over trees that constantly appear in front of you while collecting points with every passing second. But be careful, one collision with a tree, and all your points will be lost instantly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced, challenging gameplay</strong>: Match notes perfectly to achieve the highest score!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive difficulty</strong>: The higher your level, the more notes you\u2019ll have to face.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Levels</strong>: Level up and unlock each animation scene there.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple yet challenging gameplay</strong>: With just one button, control your slime to jump at the right moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cheerful and colorful graphics</strong>: Enjoy a vibrant world with a fun visual style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless challenge</strong>: The longer you survive, the faster you\u2019ll score and level up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to learn, hard to master</strong>: Perfect for casual players and hardcore gamers seeking a tougher challenge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long can you last? Test your reflexes and speed in <strong><i>Hentai</i></strong> now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865400/extras/cb32704509a3f0a5e6201ae65ea19e54.poster.avif?t=1736874021\" width=500 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865400/extras/cb32704509a3f0a5e6201ae65ea19e54.webm?t=1736874021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865400/extras/cb32704509a3f0a5e6201ae65ea19e54.mp4?t=1736874021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world of challenging theft! In <strong><i>Thief</i></strong>, you will enter mysterious houses to search for keys and collect hidden money. Prepare yourself for an exhilarating adventure, where cleverness and strategy are the keys to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Search</strong>: Explore every corner of the house and find the necessary keys to unlock doors and access new areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Money</strong>: Discover hidden cash in various locations. Every decision you make can determine the success of the mission!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Environment</strong>: Use various objects around you to hide your tracks and escape from tricky situations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Graphics</strong>: Enjoy breathtaking visuals with realistic details, immersing you in a tension-filled world of theft.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join this journey and prove that you are the best thief! Are you ready to unlock the secrets hidden within each house and claim your wealth?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the challenge now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865400/extras/bef77114130e31e820c712ac2e565321.poster.avif?t=1736874021\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865400/extras/bef77114130e31e820c712ac2e565321.webm?t=1736874021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865400/extras/bef77114130e31e820c712ac2e565321.mp4?t=1736874021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
